    "html": "<p>In an experiment monochromatic light of frequency <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"600\"></span> THz is incident on a single slit of width <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.40\"></span> mm and a diffraction pattern is formed on a screen. Then the slit width is changed to <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.60\"></span> mm. What should be the frequency of the incident light in order for the angle between the central maximum and the first minimum to remain unchanged? </p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"300\"></span> THz</li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"400\"></span> THz</li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"600\"></span> THz</li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"900\"></span> THz</li>\n</ol>"
  },
